ne/godot/pull/123768","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123768.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123768.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- **Depends on #123708**\r\n- **Depends on #123761**\r\n- **Depends on #123765**\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Diff view of Nodes shows what nodes are added or deleted, but doesn't show what nodes have changes\r\n- In my example, only 1 node appeared for orphan nodes of A and B, this is beause they shared the same (blank) name, if they have had different names i pressume obth would have shown with proper red and green colors\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n| |Before|After|\r\n|--|--|--|\r\n|Split Diff|<img width=\"1479\" height=\"832\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa91140b-d962-4d7a-aabb-17296727fcf2\" />|<img width=\"1702\" height=\"832\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ec0ff8e-e5db-4cb2-b246-dde8c9a2bcc3\" />|\r\n|Unified Diff|<img width=\"1479\" height=\"832\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6347310f-6202-48c4-b284-516124cf44d7\" />|<img width=\"1702\" height=\"832\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/406aff75-f666-4e24-994c-ae73a8ea7050\" />|\r\n\r\n## Known issue:\r\n\r\n- If i'm not mistaken, this view will not represent properly when nodes are reparented, however this issue existed before this PR\r\n- Orphan nodes with same name appears only once in the tree, i wonder if we should fix that","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123768/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}